    "['set protocols rstp interface [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'stp edged-port enable', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'stp edged-port enable', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nstp edged-port enable\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\nThe Juniper command `set protocols rstp interface ge-0/0/2 edge` configures the interface as an edge port in RSTP (Rapid Spanning Tree Protocol), which means it's directly connected to an end device and should transition immediately to forwarding state. The equivalent Huawei command is `stp edged-port enable`, which serves the same purpose of designating the port as an edge port in STP/RSTP.\", 'trans_template': 'stp edged-port enable'}]]": 1,
